flowchart TB
    Page[Inspect PDF Page Locally] --> Text[Measure Text Content]
    Page --> Raster[Measure Raster Images<br/>and Largest Image Coverage]
    Text --> Meaningful{Meaningful text?}
    Raster --> Meaningful

    Meaningful -- Yes --> Significant{Significant image<br/>coverage too?}
    Significant -- No --> TextBased[TextBased]
    Significant -- Yes --> Mixed[Mixed]

    Meaningful -- No --> PageSized{Page-sized<br/>raster image?}
    PageSized -- Yes --> Scanned[Scanned]
    PageSized -- No --> AnyImage{Any raster image?}
    AnyImage -- Yes --> ImageBased[ImageBased]
    AnyImage -- No --> Unknown[Unknown]

    TextBased --> Aggregate[Aggregate Ordered<br/>Page Classifications]
    Mixed --> Aggregate
    Scanned --> Aggregate
    ImageBased --> Aggregate
    Unknown --> Aggregate
    Aggregate --> DocumentType[Document Type<br/>dominant type, Mixed, or Unknown]

    Rule[Deterministic, versioned rules;<br/>numeric thresholds remain in the text and table] -. constrains .-> Meaningful
    Rule -. constrains .-> Aggregate

    classDef stage fill:#e5e7eb,stroke:#374151,stroke-width:1.4px,color:#111111;
    classDef outcome fill:#ffffff,stroke:#374151,stroke-width:1.4px,color:#111111;
    classDef decision fill:#fafafa,stroke:#374151,stroke-width:1.4px,color:#111111;
    classDef note fill:#fafafa,stroke:#6b7280,stroke-dasharray:5 3,color:#111111;
    class Page,Text,Raster,Aggregate,DocumentType stage;
    class TextBased,Mixed,Scanned,ImageBased,Unknown outcome;
